acceptance_criteria: "Controlled aliased TMPDIR replay fails with exactly the five initial positive authority assertions before the fixture correction and passes after; no production containment or read-error semantics, budgets, retries or assertions are weakened; native macOS pre-merge verification and required exact coverage pass before closure."
value: Catch native filesystem fixture regressions before merge and retain authority fault coverage
impact: Receipt snapshot test portability and native macOS admission
parent: pm-ycyymg
risk: low
confidence: high
expected_result: "All five unchanged fault scenarios start from valid source authority and preserve snapshot index bytes after genuine source failures, including a symlink-addressed temporary parent; the existing macOS pre-merge job executes the full snapshot suite."
actual_result: "Implemented fixture-only physical-root normalization and included the complete8-case snapshot suite in the existing native macOS merge check. Controlled external alias replay fails exactly all5 initial positive assertions before and passes after;31 connected and linked tests pass. Full Node24.21 canonical run passes11509 tests with3 platform skips at exact100/100/100/100 coverage:71103 statements,54739 branches,14625 functions,67254 lines. Typecheck/lint/workflow permissions pass. Native macOS and hosted exact coverage remain UNVERIFIED because all9 emitted source Actions jobs, including build foundation, remain queued after a20-minute watcher; missing required DeepScan independently blocks merge. No production semantics, assertions or budgets changed. The item is open pending its explicit native/hosted acceptance, with no completion or shipment claim."
