  "2026-10-27T10:39:20.310Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check: complete3139-item all-status corpus, request-specific receipt snapshot source-index alias searches and fresh context/open/in_progress inventories; full live closed source-receipt owner and recurrence measurement owner plus open reliability-lineage item inspected. The older macOS alert1544 concerns repaired cache-exclusion rules and is not this five-case receipt setup failure. Reuse completed source authority lineage through this bounded native fixture child. Report1612: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1612 ; failed native job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40482594067/job/122116361740 . No product defect or historical-rate repair is claimed."
  "2026-10-27T10:44:21.159Z","harness:codex","Controlled reproduction and correction: unchanged0af0391c1c4a4c2ff80a2e0abb74379b3bcb3169 under an external symlink-addressed TMPDIR fails exactly all five initial source-index authority assertions (expected1, actual0), with empty Vitest suite-error messages. Canonicalizing only the owned fault-fixture root makes the same five cases pass; all31 connected receipt tests and the linked execution pass. The complete8-case snapshot suite is added to the existing native macOS merge step, retaining job names, timeouts, all assertions, source index byte preservation, containment and production error behavior. Typecheck, focused ESLint, diff checks and read-only workflow permissions pass. The item remains actively claimed until native macOS and exact source coverage acceptance complete. The portable pinned counterexample was independently executed and proved all five named failures; an earlier replay setup correctly refused a TMPDIR inside its disposable checkout and is not counted as regression evidence."
  "2026-10-27T11:22:21.436Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance on c646aef86a1a8cd3ae28786def648fccfc15355a: Node24.21 full canonical run passes876 test files and11509 tests with3 legitimate platform skips. Exact coverage passes71103/71103 statements,54739/54739 branches,14625/14625 functions and67254/67254 lines, zero uncovered counts. Existing five-case aliased TMPDIR red/green, pinned unsafe-source control,31 connected/linked tests, typecheck, lint and workflow permissions remain verified. Hosted source admission is unavailable: after the bounded20-minute watcher, all9 emitted Actions jobs are still QUEUED, including the build foundation, so the native macOS step has not executed. The exact-commit analyzer gate separately refuses missing DeepScan. GitHub public status shows operational and does not establish a queue cause. The preceding0af full review finished with zero new findings; the c646 full request is rate limited until approximately11:24UTC. No remote job cancellation, threshold change or approval bypass was used. Preserve explicit native/hosted acceptance as unmet; return this implemented repair to open/unclaimed pending external execution rather than falsely close it."
  "2026-10-27T11:33:47.064Z","harness:codex","Local runtime qualification: the full canonical coverage run uses installed Node24.21 with command-local isolated npm module-resolution support required by this host, with no persistent environment change. All exact coverage metrics and11509 passing tests are verified on the unchanged source candidate; this does not certify the still-queued hosted/native check."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T11:22:23.113Z","harness:codex","Native temporary-directory aliases can differ from Git physical roots. A fixture passing linked index coordinates should canonicalize its owned root before deriving paths; use an external symlink TMPDIR to independently exercise this setup on other platforms, preserve the initial positive authority control and all fault byte assertions, and keep the actual native suite in pre-merge checks."
